        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Field Enterprises RPT-322, Solid Brass Retro Triangular Ring Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Large Triangular Ring Pull has a retro feel that is accentuated by the solid brass construction. It measures 3 inches high, making it a statement piece perfect for larger lightweight doors. Try revamping your dresser with these modish pulls; or bring the glitz and glamor of the 1920s to your kitchen cabinets with the available polished brass finish. With an easy screw-on design, this 3 inch triangular ring pull is the simple way to add style to your home \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <a href=\"/products/2-inch-triangular-ring-pull-field-enterprises-rpt-217\">Small Triangular Ring Pull</a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications and Features</b> of the Triangular RPT322 Ring Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass</li>\r\n<li>Overall Height: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Width at Top: 1-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Width at Bottom: 2-13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Grip: 3/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mount Length: 1/2\" square</li>\r\n<li>Comes packaged with mounting hardware.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
